            {
              "key": "add",
              "values": [
                "spaceport",
                "\tAround the back of the main yard, past the salvage lots, a handful of disc-shaped hulls sit under tarps. A dealer leans against one of them, arms crossed. \"Corellian Engineering builds these on New Sahara. Officially, none of them end up here.\" He pulls back a tarp to reveal a sleek, modified hull. \"The Vagabond's fast and quiet. The Privateer's for boarding work. And the Striker —\" he grins \"— the Striker's for people who think shields are a lifestyle and hull integrity is someone else's problem.\""
